title: $:/changenotes/5.5.0/#9938
description: Conditionally hide editor preview types
release: 5.5.0
tags: $:/tags/ChangeNote
change-type: feature
change-category: widget
github-links: https://github.com/TiddlyWiki/TiddlyWiki5/pull/9938
github-contributors: linonetwo

Editor preview types can now specify a `condition` filter to control their visibility. The EditWidget provides the selected editor as `tv-editor-type` for use in these filters. Preview types without a condition remain available to all editors.

Editor type mappings ignore leading and trailing whitespace, so a trailing newline in a configuration tiddler does not prevent the editor and its toolbar from loading.
